WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.671 --> 00:00:05.275
WE GO BACK TO GERALDO WHO HAS

00:00:02.973 --> 00:00:05.609
MORE NEWS THAT IS DEVELOPING.

00:00:05.409 --> 00:00:08.912
GERALDO?

00:00:05.743 --> 00:00:11.014
&gt;&gt; BREAKING, BREAKING NEWS.

00:00:09.046 --> 00:00:12.382
THE HELICOPTERS ARE OVERHEAD.

00:00:11.148 --> 00:00:16.120
THE AUSTIN POLICE DEPARTMENT

00:00:12.516 --> 00:00:22.793
JUST TWEETED OUT, THERE WAS NO

00:00:16.253 --> 00:00:25.195
PACKAGE EXPLOSION IN THE 9800

00:00:22.926 --> 00:00:27.131
BLOCK OF BRODY LANE.

00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:35.305
IT WAS AN INCENDIARY DEVICE.

00:00:27.264 --> 00:00:38.742
I REPEAT, AN INCENDIARY DEVICES.

00:00:35.439 --> 00:00:39.076
THEY HAVE NO EVIDENCE THEY'RE

00:00:38.876 --> 00:00:41.712
RELATED.

00:00:39.209 --> 00:00:44.815
SO I DON'T UNDERSTAND THIS.

00:00:41.845 --> 00:00:47.117
COULD THIS BE A SECOND ATTACKER?

00:00:44.948 --> 00:00:53.023
A SECOND BOMBER --

00:00:47.251 --> 00:00:55.559
&gt;&gt; Sean: GERALDO, HOW DO WE

00:00:53.157 --> 00:00:57.294
INTERPRET WHAT AN INCENDIARY

00:00:55.692 --> 00:01:00.697
DEVICE IS?

00:00:57.427 --> 00:01:03.667
&gt;&gt; I WOULD IMAGINE LIKE A FLARE,

00:01:00.831 --> 00:01:07.104
SOMETHING LIKE A FIRE WORK, SOME

00:01:03.801 --> 00:01:08.806
KIND OF, YOU KNOW, MORE FLAME

00:01:07.237 --> 00:01:11.041
THAN BANG.

00:01:08.939 --> 00:01:11.375
AN EXPLOSION IS AN INCENDIARY

00:01:11.175 --> 00:01:12.543
DEVICE.

00:01:11.508 --> 00:01:14.211
THERE'S NO PLACE FOR THE ENERGY

00:01:12.676 --> 00:01:18.081
TO GO.

00:01:14.344 --> 00:01:21.351
AN INCENDIARY DEVICE IS MORE --

00:01:18.215 --> 00:01:23.353
EFFORTING MORE SPECIFICS ON WHAT

00:01:21.485 --> 00:01:24.721
THE INCENDIARY DEVICE CONSISTED

00:01:23.487 --> 00:01:25.756
OF.

00:01:24.855 --> 00:01:27.357
HOPEFULLY THE AUSTIN POLICE

00:01:25.889 --> 00:01:28.892
DEPARTMENT WILL GIVE US SOME

00:01:27.491 --> 00:01:30.561
GUIDANCE.

00:01:29.026 --> 00:01:33.697
CLEARLY THERE WAS SOME KIND OF,

00:01:30.694 --> 00:01:34.865
YOU KNOW -- MAYBE THE PERSON WAS

00:01:33.831 --> 00:01:37.201
BURNED RATHER THAN BLOWN.

00:01:34.998 --> 00:01:38.802
YOU KNOW, INJURED IN TERMS OF

00:01:37.334 --> 00:01:40.704
THE EXPLOSION.

00:01:38.936 --> 00:01:41.038
I'M JUST QUOTING FROM THE

00:01:40.838 --> 00:01:44.541
POLICE.

